sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as 失主(Lost)
    participant F as 拾得者(Finder)
    participant R as Router
    participant S as HandoverService
    participant DB as Database

    Note over L,F: 前置：claim(认领) + confirm-return(确认归还) 已完成，match.status=CLAIMING

    %% ===== 失主生成码 =====
    L->>R: POST /matches/{id}/handover/generate
    R->>S: generate_code(match_id, operator_id=lost.user_id)
    S->>DB: 查 match.status == CLAIMING?
    S->>DB: 查 LostItem.publisher_id == operator_id → role="lost"
    S->>DB: 查/建 HandoverCode 行(status=VALID)
    S->>DB: SET lost_code="1234", lost_code_expire=now+10s, lost_code_verified=False
    S->>DB: 镜像 match.code="1234", match.code_expire=now+10s
    S->>DB: audit_log: handover_generate(seq, role=lost, code=1234)
    S-->>R: HandoverCode(role=lost, code="1234", expire=now+10s)
    R-->>L: {role:"lost", code:"1234", expire_at:...}

    %% ===== 拾得者生成码 =====
    F->>R: POST /matches/{id}/handover/generate
    R->>S: generate_code(match_id, operator_id=finder.user_id)
    S->>DB: 查 FoundItem.finder_id == operator_id → role="finder"
    S->>DB: 查同一 HandoverCode 行(status=VALID)
    S->>DB: SET finder_code="5678", finder_code_expire=now+10s, finder_code_verified=False
    S->>DB: 镜像 match.code="5678", match.code_expire=now+10s
    S->>DB: audit_log: handover_generate(seq, role=finder, code=5678)
    S-->>R: HandoverCode(role=finder, code="5678", expire=now+10s)
    R-->>F: {role:"finder", code:"5678", expire_at:...}

    %% ===== 拾得者交叉验证（输入失主的码） =====
    F->>R: POST /matches/{id}/handover/verify {code:"1234", role:"finder", gps:"..."}
    R->>S: verify(match_id, code="1234", role="finder", gps, operator_id)
    S->>DB: 查 HandoverCode(match_id, status=VALID) 最新 seq
    S->>DB: role="finder" → target = lost_code="1234"
    S->>DB: 校验 lost_code != None ✓
    S->>DB: 校验 lost_code == "1234" ✓
    S->>DB: 校验 lost_code_expire > now ✓
    S->>DB: SET lost_code_verified=True, gps_finder=gps
    S->>DB: both = lost_code_verified AND finder_code_verified = False
    S-->>R: {both_verified:false, lost_code_verified:true, finder_code_verified:false}
    R-->>F: {both_verified:false, lost_code_verified:true, finder_code_verified:false}

    %% ===== 失主交叉验证（输入拾得者的码） =====
    L->>R: POST /matches/{id}/handover/verify {code:"5678", role:"lost", gps:"..."}
    R->>S: verify(match_id, code="5678", role="lost", gps, operator_id)
    S->>DB: 查 HandoverCode(match_id, status=VALID) 最新 seq
    S->>DB: role="lost" → target = finder_code="5678"
    S->>DB: 校验 finder_code != None ✓
    S->>DB: 校验 finder_code == "5678" ✓
    S->>DB: 校验 finder_code_expire > now ✓
    S->>DB: SET finder_code_verified=True, gps_lost=gps
    S->>DB: both = True → SET hc.status=VERIFIED
    S->>DB: SET match.status=COMPLETED, completed_at=now
    S->>DB: SET lost.status=RESOLVED, found.status=RESOLVED
    S->>DB: SET lost.expires_at=now+90d, found.expires_at=now+90d
    S->>DB: audit_log: handover_complete(seq, lost_code, finder_code)
    S-->>R: {both_verified:true, lost_code_verified:true, finder_code_verified:true}
    R-->>L: {both_verified:true, lost_code_verified:true, finder_code_verified:true}

    Note over L,F: 交接完成 — match.status=COMPLETED, lost/found=RESOLVED

    %% ===== 边界：码过期重新生成 =====
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over L,F: 边界场景：码过期后重新生成
        L->>R: POST /matches/{id}/handover/generate (码已过期)
        R->>S: generate_code(match_id, operator_id=lost.user_id)
        S->>DB: 查同一 HandoverCode 行(status=VALID)
        S->>DB: 覆盖 lost_code="9999", lost_code_expire=now+10s
        S->>DB: 重置 lost_code_verified=False
        Note right of S: finder_code 及 finder_code_verified 不受影响
        S-->>R: HandoverCode(role=lost, code="9999")
        R-->>L: {role:"lost", code:"9999", expire_at:...}
    end
